Shadow Match - Personal_Evaluation_Report
This document contains the results of a comprehensive psychometric and aptitude assessment conducted by Shadow Match, a talent assessment and organizational development company based in Pretoria.

The evaluation provides insight into my cognitive abilities, behavioural preferences, problem-solving approach, communication style, and workplace strengths. As part of my professional portfolio, it demonstrates my suitability for analytical and business-focused roles by highlighting characteristics such as critical thinking, attention to detail, adaptability, and decision-making capability.

The report serves as an independent assessment of my potential to contribute effectively in data-driven and business analysis environments.


Recommendation Letter.pdf
This recommendation letter confirms my employment with Hostings 101, a Pretoria-based company specializing in Search Engine Optimization (SEO), web hosting, and website design, where I served as a Project Coordinator and Systems Maintenance & SEO Trainee.

In this role, I gained experience coordinating project activities, assisting with system maintenance tasks, and working alongside a small technical team as well as external consultants to ensure the smooth execution of client and internal projects. The position exposed me to structured workflows, process coordination, problem-solving, and the practical interaction between business requirements and technical implementation.

As part of my professional development, I also completed certification in Graphics and Website Design to better understand the principles behind web technologies and digital solutions. Although I do not intend to pursue a career in web development, this technical foundation enhances my ability to communicate effectively with developers, understand system functionality, and contribute to requirements gathering and solution analysis.

This experience strengthened my organizational, analytical, and cross-functional collaboration skills, providing a solid foundation for my transition into a Business Analyst career.


